# lumen configuration schema — DOCUMENTATION ONLY.
# Real values live in OpenBao at kv/data/lumen/{env}, rendered into the pod env
# by ExternalSecrets (INFRA §5). Committing a VALUE here or anywhere is a
# doctrine break; this file lists KEYS and their meaning.

# Runtime env (12-factor: the process reads its environment, never a file):
#
#   LUMEN_DB_URL      postgres:// connection string for Patroni (host = service).
#                     Dev: docker-compose.dev.yml (the password there is a
#                     local-dev placeholder for a disposable container — never
#                     reused; prod DB creds are generated in-cluster, INFRA §5).
#   PORT              HTTP listen port (default 8080; the unrouted admin/metrics
#                     port per observability contract stays separate when added).
#   ORIGIN            absolute base for feed URLs / redirects (prod: https://gofar.id).
#   SESSION_JWT_SECRET  32 random bytes, generated at bootstrap — added in M3
#                     (lumen §8 JWT sessions). Lives ONLY in Bao lumen/{env}.
#   MEDIA_*           bucket/endpoint/CDN base/access keys — added in M5
#                     (HUMAN-GATE #9 provider choice; schema finalized then).
